ache-Line Contention** | **0 Faults** | `alignas(64)` padding prevents L1/L2 false sharing |\n| **Fuzzing & Payload Safety** | **100,000 Payloads (0 Crashes)** | Malformed input validation and ring buffer bounds lock |\n\n---\n\n### Summary of Accomplishments\n\n1. **SOVRA DSL v2.0 Specification Codified**: Documented at [docs/SOVRA_DSL_SYNTAX_SPECIFICATION.md](file:///Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/docs/SOVRA_DSL_SYNTAX_SPECIFICATION.md).\n2. **AST OWASP ASI-01 & Taint Lattice Invariants**: Fully verified by compile-time rejection vectors in `sovrac`.\n3. **Pure Bare-Metal M4 Execution**: Verified via `run_baremetal_zig_suite` (4/4 passed) and full E2E Python suite (52/52 passed).\n4. **Lock-Free Multi-Agent SHM Benchmark**: Measured **78.89 Million ops/sec** across 22 concurrent agent nodes with 0 cache-line contention and zero memory leaks."}
